<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01 · 完结体：完全、彻底、耗尽与终结 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Perfective UP: Completion & Exhaustion — EPE Ch.1 §17 & Ch.16</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>357 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.1 §17 & Ch.16)：</b>当我们向容器内倒水或装东西时（<i>fill up a bag</i>），随着容量趋于极限，液面或堆积高度会<b>一直上升直至触及容器顶端边界（Full = Up to the brim）</b>。由此衍生出英语中最强大的<b>「完结体小品词 (Perfective UP)」</b>：表示动作执行得<b>比单纯动词更彻底、更完全、直到目标被彻底耗光或终结</b>（例如 <i>cut up an onion</i> 比 <i>cut</i> 切得更碎更彻底，<i>eat/use/drink/dry up</i> 表示彻底耗尽见底）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 11 个核心义项'>2/11</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [assemble] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>create by putting components or members together</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>assemble, piece</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>She pieced a quilt.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>He tacked together some verses.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>They <b>set</b> <b>up</b> a committee.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>make <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 9 个核心义项'>4/9</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: tidy)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>put in order or neaten</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>tidy, neaten</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Make the bed.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span><b>Make</b> <b>up</b> a room.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 13 个核心义项'>4/13</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [occupy] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>take up time or space</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>occupy, fill</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span><b>Take</b> <b>up</b> the slack.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>give <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 10 个核心义项'>2/10</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: quit)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>give up in the face of defeat of lacking hope; admit defeat</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>quit</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>In the second round, the challenger gave up.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>make <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 9 个核心义项'>7/9</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: groom)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>apply make-up or cosmetics to one's face to appear prettier</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>groom, neaten</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>She <b>makes</b> herself <b>up</b> every morning.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 13 个核心义项'>11/13</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [consume] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>take up as if with a sponge</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>consume, ingest</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>They decided to <b>take</b> it <b>up</b> right away.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>hold <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>4/6</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: rob)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>rob at gunpoint or by means of some other threat</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>rob</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>They decided to <b>hold</b> it <b>up</b> right away.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>blow <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>4/7</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [inflate] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>fill with gas or air</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>inflate, expand</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Inflate a balloons.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>do <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [groom] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>use special care in dressing, making-up, etc.</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>groom, neaten</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>She <b>dolled</b> herself <b>up</b> for the night out with her friends.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>4/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>burn completely; be consumed or destroyed by fire</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>burn, combust</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The hut burned down.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The mountain of paper went up in flames.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>use <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库学术/公文分布比高 (2.648x) + 作为正式词 [consume] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>use up (resources or materials)</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>consume, eat</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>This car consumes a lot of gas.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>We exhausted our savings.</div></div>
