<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02 · 垂直上升、数值暴涨与强度升级 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>UP IS MORE / STRONGER — EPE Ch.16 & Ch.1</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>100 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.16)：</b>源于人类日常物理经验：当物体堆叠得更多时，堆叠高度就会上升（<b>Systemic Metaphor: UP IS MORE</b>）。因此，除物理向高处位移（<i>climb/lift/pick up</i>）外，一切<b>价格、数量、速度、音量、温度的增长与程度强化</b>（<i>shoot/soar/mount/step/beef/warm up</i>），以及情绪能量的高涨振作（<i>cheer/perk up</i>）均使用 UP。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
