<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>I hope the list key is going to surface again.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>2/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: fold)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>bend or lay so that one part covers the other</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>fold</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Fold up the newspaper.</div></div>
