<details class='sub-section' id='sub_2'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>03 · 进入视野、凭空出现、构想编造与建立 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Visibility, Emergence & Creation — EPE Ch.9 §4.1.3 & Ch.16</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>90 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.9 & Ch.16)：</b>在地面或海平面以下的事物是看不见的，一旦<b>向上升起到与人眼齐平的高度（Up to eye level）就会变得清晰可见（Visible & Accessible）</b>。因此，原本不存在或隐藏的事物突然显露（<i>turn/show/crop up</i>）、把话题端上桌面提及（<i>bring up</i>）、在脑海中把点子或故事从无到有构建出来（<i>make/cook/dream/set up</i>）都用 UP。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>make <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 9 个核心义项'>1/9</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [constitute] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>form or compose</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>constitute, represent</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>This money is my only income.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The stone wall was the backdrop for the performance.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>These constitute my entire belonging.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 11 个核心义项'>1/11</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [establish] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>set up or found</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>establish, found</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>She <b>set</b> <b>up</b> a literacy program.</div></div></div></td></tr>
