<details class='sub-section' id='sub_3'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>04 · 封锁合拢、束缚限制与彻底分割破碎 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Closure, Fastening, Restriction & Division — EPE Ch.1 §19 & Ch.16</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>66 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.1 Table 1.16 & Ch.16)：</b>这里融合了两个紧密关联的完结体图式：① <b>向上拉合封口</b>：像把袋子口向上提拉系紧、拉链拉到顶一样，表示彻底封死、捆绑或压抑（<i>lock/tie/zip/board/bottle up</i>）；② <b>彻底解体（Thorough Disintegration）</b>：如 EPE Table 1.16 分析 <i>break up some ice</i>，这里的 UP 是完结体用法，强调把原本完整的物体彻底切碎、撕碎或炸碎成无数小块（<i>tear/cut/rip/blow/split up</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>hold <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>1/6</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [support] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be the physical support of; carry the weight of</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>support</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The beam <b>holds</b> <b>up</b> the roof.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>He supported me with one hand while I balanced on the beam.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>What's holding that mirror?</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>hold <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>2/6</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [delay] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>cause to be slowed down or delayed</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>delay, detain</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Traffic was delayed by the bad weather.</div></div>
